sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant API as Invoice API
    participant DB as Database and outbox
    participant Worker as Submission worker
    participant PayEx as PayEx

    Approver->>API: Approve invoice
    API->>DB: Save decision, audit and outbox transactionally
    DB-->>API: Commit successful
    API-->>Approver: Approval recorded; submission pending

    Worker->>DB: Read pending outbox item
    Worker->>PayEx: Submit using stable idempotency key
    PayEx-->>Worker: Return result or timeout

    Worker->>DB: Record outcome and provider reference
    Note over Worker,PayEx: On timeout, retry with the same key if supported; otherwise reconcile first